was also able to gain

248
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:18,777
back 1500 life points this
could be just the break

249
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:22,200
kaiba needed to make his
comeback let's hope so

250
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:27,497
all right siegfried it's time
to get rid of your little

251
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:32,240
friend along with the horse she
rode in on Dragon Cannon, attack!

252
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,880
Way to go, Seto!

253
00:16:39,140 --> 00:16:40,100
Nice move.

254
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:42,397
He totally caught Siegfried off guard.

255
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,520
That's my bro!

256
00:16:43,820 --> 00:16:45,320
Always one step ahead!

257
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,160
One step ahead?

258
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:49,940
I swore that would never happen again.

259
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,280
Nice work.

260
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:54,757
Thanks to him, the gaming
industry will never be the same.

261
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,240
Seto Kaiba's a genius.

262
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,110
No!

263
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,140
I'm too late!

264
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:10,920
Oh, great. You can't.

265
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:12,720
That idea belongs to me.

266
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:18,720
He's beat me to the
punch for the last time.

267
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:22,437
Kaiba's not out of trouble yet.

268
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,638
And now it's Siegfried's turn again.

269
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:28,060
Hmm, how to destroy you?

270
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,960
I think Nibelung's
treasure is a good start.

271
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,620
Hold on a sec.

272
00:17:33,980 --> 00:17:36,780
Isn't that the same card
he used to do you in?

273
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,310
That's it.

274
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:40,300
And it's not a fond memory.

275
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,980
This lets me play Nibelung's ring.

276
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:47,101
But since I'm feeling generous,
I'll give it to your dragon cannon.

277
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:50,080
I also get to draw five new cards.

278
00:17:50,260 --> 00:17:53,142
And my ring stops your
monster from attacking me.

279
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:57,680
So much for your big, bad
dragon cannon savings a day.

280
00:17:58,400 --> 00:18:00,120
And it gets worse, guys.

281
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:03,237
Next, Kaiba has to draw
two cards from his deck.

282
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:08,140
And if either one is a monster card,
he has to remove it from the game.

283
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:11,580
Now I sacrifice my Valkyrie Dritter.

284
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:16,120
That lets me call forth the
instrument of your destruction.

285
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:24,650
What's that?

286
00:18:24,733 --> 00:18:26,700
Why, it's my Fortune Chariot!

287
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:30,540
And it's come to cart
you away into oblivion!

288
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:42,560
Now that my Valkyrie Zwei has taken the
driver's seat, the real fun can begin.

289
00:18:42,940 --> 00:18:45,940
By reducing my monster's
strength for one turn,

290
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:50,520
Fortune Chariot allows her
certain, shall we say, privileges.

291
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:56,900
For instance, my Valkyrie can bypass
your dragon and attack you directly!

292
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,500
Oh, man!

293
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:00,420
Now, Valkyrie spy!

294
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,180
Attack Herr Kaiba's life points!

295
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,280
Seto, no!

296
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:18,637
Hang in there!

297
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:23,360
As a rule, I usually refrain from
kicking a man when he's down,

298
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,457
but for you I'll make an exception.

299
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:28,160
So go, mystical space typhoon!

300
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:32,160
Next I'll play this and end my turn.

301
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,520
Did you see what I did, sir?

302
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:39,560
Since I just destroyed your
soul-absorption magic card,

303
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,857
you can't replenish your life points.

304
00:19:41,940 --> 00:19:45,020
And as long as my fortune
chariot is in play,

305
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:49,397
I can continue to chip away at your
life points until you have nothing.

306
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:52,520
Now who's one step ahead, Herr Khyber?
